{"server":"en","storyId":"story_otter_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_otter_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"One Packed Daily Schedule","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"Interlude","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_otter_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"291b925520d11c5cc3310ec4b1dfc0db41d2c4670033c62bc1ff3837718b8dea","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"个人剧情 梅尔"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"Rhodes Island Landship\n'Lutra Workshop'"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Ooh, looks like it's about time. Gotta get to work now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Lemme see the schedule for today."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Mmm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Mmyeah, works for me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's get around to Maggy's 'Improvement proposals for Drone Dragonfly operation' and polish off my submissions for today. Get around to the rest later. Then I just gotta wait for her."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Doing maintenance on Saria's armor? Main thing should be giving it a new coat of paint... crap, did I not order paint?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Arghh—we're good, we're good. Didn't use it up last time."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Main focus for today'll be that."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"If I get the time, I'll send some orders for a couple new parts. Then I can give all my frontline Meeboos some real maintenance."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Mm-hm. Today's lineup, sorted."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's kick it off!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Mayer!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Mayer, open the door!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"It's urgent!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Not too happy about Saria's suit here..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Wonder why it can't charge up properly."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Weird. C'mon, where's the problem, officer?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Mayer! I know you're in there!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I hear you talking!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Rooound here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah-hah~ Gotcha."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Prime suspect found. We're on Easy Street now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Don't make me do it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Just need to restore a failed node, and the whole suit should be back up and working again."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Uh-huh. Optimize charge circuits first. Paint over next. You'll be back to regular service in no time."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"D'you want some extra features while I'm at it? Hmm."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"//（开门的音效）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh. I don't know if Kal'tsit's gonna chew me out for abusing privileges..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Who cares. Your fault for acting deaf, Mayer."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Mayer!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Settled."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Check over your nodes one more time. Gonna be a pain once the paint gets all in you."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Working with earphones in? Aren't you worried someone's gonna spook you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Mmm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Hm-hmm—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"(Claps Mayer's shoulder)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"(Opens mouth and bites)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Waaagghahagh!!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Ow, ow!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Let go of me, damnit, let go of me!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm a BAD meal!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"You really blew it, Mayer. I had something good for you, and you wouldn't even open the door for me. Plus, you bit me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Sorry, Closure. But, like, you know I bite when someone interrupts my work."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Owwieeee."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Fine, I'll let you bite me too, then. Fair's fair?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"You're applying anti-Originium paint to a suit right now, I see?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Sure am."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Pass, then. I bite you here and one moment later I'll be in Medical. Not worth it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Eh, I guess you're not wrong."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Mmm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Closure?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"What's up?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"The door's stuck open."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"I specifically remember setting it up to automatically open and close. Pretty sure I also set it a moment ago to 'do not disturb.'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Did you just hack my door?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Uhh—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"No way~~ It was like that when I walked in."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Your door just wasn't locked."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Didn't I lock it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"...Weird."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Can you gimme a moment? I'll check the tapes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"You put a camera up?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"I got a lotta sensitive Rhine material in here, y'know? It'd be bad news for all of us if I lost something."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Gotta take basic security measures."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Nah, you should get back to work for now..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"R—Remember your health and safety regs. This paint's, uh, pretty dangerous, yeah? Things could go wrong with you trying to multitask!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"It's fine, I've got mechanical arms on it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmm, which program was it again?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Er, Mayer, don't you think this paint's gonna go volatile soon?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"That paint? It's fine, sheesh. It's inert."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"You could dump it in boiling water and ionize it for three hours, freeze it, and it'd still be good to go the moment it thaws."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Is this the folder?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"OK, monitor program, on."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Time seek to—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Mayer!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's make smart robots together!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Mayer?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"——!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"M—Mayer?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"What did you just say?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Could—Could you repeat that?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Make some smart robots with me?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Sure!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Then let's work specifics somewh—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"(Presses monitor feed transmission toggle)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Bzzzz—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Monitor Feed","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"(Sound of door opening)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Monitor Feed","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh. I don't know if Kal'tsit's gonna chew me out for abusing privileges..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Monitor Feed","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Who cares. Your fault for acting deaf, Mayer."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Meeboos."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Get her ass."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meeboos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"AaaaghhI'msorryit'smyfault don't sic the Meeboos on me ow ow ow ow waaaghhhhh!!!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Yeah, go on. What was it you wanted me for?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Uwaaahh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"I wanted you to help me with an explosive-type thingy..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Underlying machine's a Raythean Challenger Hellcat high-performance operation platform..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Topside already has a custom-ordered full-thermal Arts impact generator..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"But it's not working a hundred percent perfect, so I need your help..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Uwaaahh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Yeah, okay."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Just take a sniff of this first."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Okaaaayhhh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"(Inhale)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"I know this!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"(Takes a deep breath)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"You better now?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Hahhhh~~~~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Better!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Eheheheh. Thanks, Mayer."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"We're not gonna get any business done with you bawling your eyes out."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"True that, heheh."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Still dunno why you love sniffing the refined lubricant I have in here..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Well, 'cause it smells good, duh."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Guess Warfarin wasn't wrong. There's no blood in your veins, just machine oil."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Enough of that. Let's get real."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Aye-aye."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"You need me to refit the Raythean Challenger. Raise its attack power. Right?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Also, self-defense, damage resist, and evac plans. After all, we're gonna put a smart little guy in there. Can't have it breaking after one use."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Then you came to the right person."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Now. My reward?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Remember how there was a little hoard in the hangar? As long as you—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll take the job!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Heheh. Let's get along, partner."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Gettin' along, gettin' along~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"But, uh."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"What?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"See the blackboard over there?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Covered in sticky notes?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Yeah."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"That's my schedule."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Even if as a rush job, your commission still lands bottom-right of the very last note."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Uhh—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Any way I can jump the queue?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"No, sirree."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"So in other words, two months."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Work fast, it'll be fifty days."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you really work that fast?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Decently. Sometimes inspiration hits and the work's done."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Er... I'll leave you to it, then..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Good luck with work!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Hold it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"You format the door for me first. I need to do its settings over."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Also, strip your sys-op authority off it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Right now. Straight away. Giddy up."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Uhh—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Closure","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"Awright..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"Two hours later..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Just the laaast bit—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Ding dong!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Mayer, it's me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Um..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Did you change the password? Is that why the door's not opening?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"And that should be about done."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh? Someone at the door again?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"It's me!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Maggy! The door's broken! Push the button on the side and come in!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Hi, you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Heyo."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm still busy with something for Saria here. Can't lay out the carpet for you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"So, you need something from me?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"I made a reservation."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Drone plans. Wondering how they're doing?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh... oh!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"That. Already done."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Listed out some technical essentials, improvement proposals and required materials. Everything's in that file on the table there. You look through, and if it's all good, we can set up a new time to help you make some fitting parts."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"If you've got issues with it, we'll have a meeting about it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Rightie. Thanks, Mayer."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Which file on which table is it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"That one, that one."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Your mechanical arms are pointing at at least four different tables. How should I know which one?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Mayeeer—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Ahhh don't pull me! I'm still painting here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"You can leave paint and keep painting later. Help me find the files first, okay?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Mayeeeer~~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"I get it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Mm-hm. Thankies~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Mmn—it's this one."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"These are your expensed items for last month."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, sorry. I meant this one."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Mmm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Yep, that's it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Thank you, Mayer!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Ain't no thang. Just what I oughta do."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Then I'll be heading out now. Bye-bye."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"I almost forgot the most important part!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Can I ask you what the time is right now?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Noon, right?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Afternoon already!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Mayer, have you eaten yet?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh? You mean me? I eat an energy bar and I'm fine."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"That's no good!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Here, take this!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"This is?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"I bought it at the cafeteria. They had the freshwater stuff you love today."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"I wanted you to come eat with me, but then I lost track of time myself..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"So after I finished eating, I got a portion bagged up to bring over."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Ooh, thanks."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Make sure you eat it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Mm-hm, I will."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Anything else?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Is this Saria's Charged Suit?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"That it is."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"How much longer will you be working?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"An hour or two-ish."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Well, that's no good. Let me help you out there."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"It's fine, I can do it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Either you let me help you, or I feed you your meal. Pick one."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Alright fine I get it! Give me a hand."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Hehe~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Then let's get to work~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Phew. We're done."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Good work."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"C'mere and wash your hands."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Alright—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"*Sigh*... It's only times like these I miss all of Rhine's self-cleaning facilities."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"So why don't you go back?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"If I went back, they'd set me up with a mountain of annoying work, and I'd have no time to improve my Meeboos."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"And, like, I had to deal with interpersonal stuff there too."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Like you don't have to here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"You're always out on fieldwork. You don't know all the politics and warring between sections."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Over there, right? You'd make a new friend one day, turn around, and bam, someone tells you 'they're from the blah-blah section, best you stay away from them.'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"And what's worse is even if you're in the same section, sometimes your bosses are competing and you're all trying to drag each other down."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"That's stuff I'm, like, just not good at dealing with."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"So I ended up scarpering here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"I see..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Sorry, I shouldn't have asked you about..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"It's okay..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Alright, let's eat."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Then I should be on my way."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Meeboos, can I ask you to keep an eye on her? Otherwise she'll go straight back to work the moment I'm gone."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"My Meeboos don't have voice modules. They won't answer you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"I still have to nag you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Magallan","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"Okay then. This time I'm really off. Bye-bye."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Bye bye."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmm, maybe I should put those part orders through before I eat—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Whuah! What the hell are you doing, Meeboos?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meeboos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"It's just a little bit of work. I'm not gonna forget to eat."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meeboos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Fine, I get it, I'm eating, I'm eating now!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Phew, I'm stuffed. Alright, work!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Mmm, order parts first or fix some Meeboos first?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meeboos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Meeboos win out, yeah. Meeboos are more important."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"C'mere."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meeboos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Lemme see—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Touch up paint, inspect wiring, update data, replenish energy."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"That's what Meeboo maintenance is made of..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Better!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Still four more on mission duty, and my five reserve ones need servicing too."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"What time is it, again?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Looks like I can get 'em done today."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Mmm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Probably. Probably can."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"As long as nobody else—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Mayer! Open up!! Work needs you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"——————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, c'mon, for fffff~!@~#!@..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"*Huff*, *huff*."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Stay cool."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"In—out, in—out."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Smile~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Alright."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"Whoa, so you're in."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"What's got you all smiles and rainbows?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"You come here. I'll tell you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"Sure—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"See? This is a Meeboo."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"I know."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Stick your hand out. It's got something good for you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh, don't hear that every day. Wonder what it is?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Meeboo, get his ass."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meeboos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"Aaaaarggh-don't-bite-me-ow-ow-ow-ow-ow!!!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"Late night"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Ahhh—finally."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"All done!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Everything I planned this morning is all done!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meeboos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Ahh—that doesn't count. I made the executive decision just now to move ordering parts to tomorrow."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meeboos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Lemme see what I gotta do tomorrow."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Go to the Procurement Department and order parts."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Need to install test equipment for Medical."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, gotta debug my workbench again."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"That should settle tomorrow's lineup."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Time is... 11:36."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Mm, yeah, I should crash."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Eat a bowl of instant noodles and then sleep."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"See you tomorrow, Meeboos."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meeboos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mayer","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"Agh—ow, ow!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_007_closre","aliases":["???","Closure"]},{"speakerId":"char_242_mayer","aliases":["???","Mayer"]},{"speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","aliases":["Magallan"]}]}
